        "### Inputs\n\nLoad your source image/media here.\n\nThe green value boxes here feed settings further along\nthe graph - change them here, not at the node they\nconnect to.\n\nType what you want in the green prompt box(es) here.\n\nMiniMaxH3ImageToVideo takes clip+vae+prompt directly\nand outputs BOTH the positive CONDITIONING and the\nLATENT - there is no separate CLIPTextEncode or empty-\nlatent node in the i2v path. For t2v use\nEmptyMiniMaxH3LatentAV instead.\nMiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo uses <Picture i> / <Video k>\n/ <Audio j> tags - use the same tags in the prompt\ntext.\n\n| knob | now | range / choices | effect |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| PrimitiveFloat #133 | 2 | | A hand-set value wired into the graph - the node title says what it sets. |\n| PrimitiveInt #137 | 20 | | A hand-set value wired into the graph - the node title says what it sets. |\n| PrimitiveInt #138 | 6 | | A hand-set value wired into the graph - the node title says what it sets. |\n| PrimitiveBoolean #139 | False | | A hand-set value wired into the graph - the node title says what it sets. |\n| aspect_ratio (ResolutionSelector #115) | 1:1 (Square) |  | The canvas shape - changes the composition the model lays out, not just the crop. |\n| megapixels (ResolutionSelector #115) | 0.59 | 0.1-16.0 | Total output size - higher adds detail and render time; far outside the model's trained range looks soft or breaks up. |\n| width (MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo #131) | *(wired)* | | |\n| height (MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo #131) | *(wired)* | | |"
      ],
      "title": "Inputs",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 202,
